text NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_MomTalk_MOMWowThatS {
	poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
		SPANISH: "MAMÁ: Vaya, ¡qué {POKEMON} tan mono!\n¿De dónde lo has sacado?\p…\pAsí que te vas de aventuras…\p¡Está bien! Yo también te ayudaré.\nPero, ¿qué puedo hacer por ti?\p¡Ya lo sé!\n¡Guardaré dinero para ti!\pEn un viaje tan largo, el dinero\nes muy importante.\p¿Quieres que te guarde el dinero?"
		_: "MOM: Wow, that's a cute {POKEMON}.\n"
                   "Where did you get it?\p"
                   "…\p"
                   "So, you're leaving on an adventure…\p"
                   "Okay! I'll help too.\n"
                   "But what can I do for you?\p"
                   "I know!\n"
                   "I'll save money for you.\p"
                   "On a long journey, money is very\n"
                   "important.\p"
                   "Do you want me to save your money?"
	}
}

text NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_MomTalk_OkayILlTake {
	poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
		SPANISH: "Vale, me encargo de tu dinero.\n………………"
		_: "Okay, I'll take care of your money.\n"
                   "………………"
	}
}

text NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_MomTalk_BeCarefulPPokemon {
	poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
		SPANISH: "Ten cuidado.\pLos {POKEMON} son tus amigos.\nTenéis que trabajar en equipo.\p¡Ahora, adelante!"
		_: "Be careful.\p"
                   "{POKEMON} are your friends.\n"
                   "You need to work as a team.\p"
                   "Now, go on!"
	}
}

text NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_MomTalk_MOMSoWhatWas {
	poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
		SPANISH: "MAMÁ: Entonces, ¿cuál era el encargo\ndel PROF. ELM?\p…\nParece muy difícil.\pDeberías sentirte orgullos{KUN}\nde que la gente confíe en ti."
		_: "MOM: So, what was PROF. ELM's\n"
                   "errand?\p"
                   "…\n"
                   "That does sound challenging.\p"
                   "But, you should be proud that\n"
                   "people rely on you."
	}
}

text NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_NewBarkTown_PlayersHouse_1F_MomTalk_MOMPROFELMIs {
	poryswitch(LANGUAGE) {
		SPANISH: "MAMÁ: El PROF. ELM te está esperando.\n¡Date prisa!"
